<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>
Distribution of <span id="A6.T11.23" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Pearson</span> and <span id="A6.T11.24" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Kendall</span> correlation coefficients between automated rankings and human ranking on the <span id="A6.T11.25" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">MMLU</span> dataset. Each value reflects micro-level alignment computed per individual problem. The first six columns report the performance of individual LLMs, while the remaining columns correspond to various rank aggregation methods. Reported statistics include the Mean, standard deviation (<span id="A6.T11.26" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Std.</span>), minimum (<span id="A6.T11.27" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Min</span>), and the 25th, 50th (median), 75th percentiles, and maximum (<span id="A6.T11.28" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Max</span>) values across all problems. Abbreviations: <span id="A6.T11.29" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Avg</span> = average voting, <span id="A6.T11.30" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Dod</span> = Dodgson, <span id="A6.T11.31" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Cop</span> = Condorcet, <span id="A6.T11.32" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Bor</span> = Borda, <span id="A6.T11.33" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Irv</span> = Instant-runoff voting, <span id="A6.T11.34" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Spm</span> = Spearman, <span id="A6.T11.35" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Kem</span> = Kemeny-Young, <span id="A6.T11.36" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Ken</span> = Kendall. Models: <span id="A6.T11.37" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4o11</span> = GPT-4o-2024-11-20, <span id="A6.T11.38" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4o05</span> = GPT-4o-2024-05-13, <span id="A6.T11.39" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4o08</span> = GPT-4o-2024-08-06, <span id="A6.T11.40" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Sn10</span> = Claude-3.5-Sonnet-20241022, <span id="A6.T11.41" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hk10</span> = Claude-3.5-Haiku-20241022, <span id="A6.T11.42" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Op02</span> = Claude-3-Opus-20240229. Darker orange indicates stronger alignment with human judgment, with deeper hues highlighting higher correlation values.
</figcaption>
</figure>
