<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a reviewer assigned to rank multiple answers written in Chinese. Your evaluation must be based solely on the following three criteria:</span></span>
<span id="A9.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<span id="A9.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A9.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A9.I3.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I3.i1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Linguistic Accuracy</span><span id="A9.I3.i1.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Are the grammar, vocabulary, and expressions consistent with standard modern Chinese?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A9.I3.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<span id="A9.I3.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<span id="A9.I3.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I3.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Clarity of Expression</span><span id="A9.I3.i2.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Is the language smooth, natural, and easy to understand? Is the logic clearly conveyed?</span></span>
</span></span>
<span id="A9.I3.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
