<span id="A9.I3.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.I3.i3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Contextual Appropriateness</span><span id="A9.I3.i3.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">: Does the response match the intended tone, audience, and context of the prompt?</span></span>
</span></span>
</span>
<span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.p3.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Please strictly follow the format below:</span></span>
